# Theory Design System (`ta-*`)

## Reference Files
- Components: `src/styles/components/theory-apple.css`
- Shell: `src/components/TheoryTab.tsx` | Hub: `src/components/theory/TheoryChapterHub.tsx`
- Hooks/Tokens: `src/hooks/useTheoryDesign.ts`

## Core Concepts
- **Shell**: Root container is `.ta-shell`. Inside shell, use variables `--ta-*` (surfaces: `bg`, `surface`, `border`; text: `text`, `text-muted`, `text-dim`; accent: `sec-01` to `sec-10` + tint; card overrides; radius, shadow, motion, display-font).
- **Typography**: Eyebrow/Pill (12px, 600, uppercase, spacing 0.22em), title (32px, 600, display-font), card title (20px, 600), body (16px, 400), muted (14px, 400).
- **Spacing/Layout**: Multiples of 4. Section padding: `96px 32px` (mobile: `72px 18px`). Max-width: inner `1140px`, lede `640px`. Grid gap: `16px`. Section head gap: `12px`, mb: `48px`.
- **States**: default, hover (border-strong, shadow), active (tint, border-accent), focus-visible (outline offset 2px), disabled, loading. Easing curves: micro (200ms), component (400ms), section (500ms).
- **A11y/Motion**: Support `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)`, hook `motion.reduced`. Stagger 80ms. Div click is banned.

## Rules
- Use CSS custom properties in TSX: `var(--ta-*)`. No inline raw hex.
- Do not edit reference Theory components unless specifically requested.
- Use `useTheoryDesign()` for design tokens in new components.
